1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,425
Online payments are part of
everyday life, and so is fraud.

2
00:00:05,375 --> 00:00:11,550
Spotting suspicious activity quickly, and
understanding why it happened, is hard.

3
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,275
That's where Sentinel comes in.

4
00:00:15,275 --> 00:00:19,550
Sentinel is an AI-powered
payment risk platform.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:25,742
It combines machine learning, graph
intelligence, and an AI investigation agent, to

6
00:00:25,742 --> 00:00:28,900
flag suspicious payments and explain them.

7
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,788
All the data here is synthetic.

8
00:00:32,788 --> 00:00:36,362
At its core is PayPal's Orders API.

9
00:00:36,312 --> 00:00:41,839
Our demo marketplace creates a PayPal
Sandbox order on the server, and Sentinel

10
00:00:41,839 --> 00:00:47,225
scores the payment after the buyer
approves it, before any money is captured.

11
00:00:47,225 --> 00:00:53,515
Our Sandbox keys aren't configured in this
recording, so checkout says so clearly,

12
00:00:53,515 --> 00:00:55,663
instead of faking a payment.

13
00:00:56,663 --> 00:01:00,425
Ben usually spends about
thirty-eight dollars.

14
00:01:00,375 --> 00:01:05,338
Now he's buying an eighteen hundred
dollar laptop on a new device.

15
00:01:05,338 --> 00:01:10,838
The model scores the payment, and SHAP
shows which factors drove that score.

16
00:01:10,838 --> 00:01:16,250
At forty-three times his average,
the policy holds it for verification.

17
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:20,138
Fraud often isn't isolated.

18
00:01:20,088 --> 00:01:26,812
Sentinel builds a graph of customers,
devices, merchants, and payment destinations.

19
00:01:26,812 --> 00:01:32,013
To the model alone, Cara's gift
card looked only medium risk.

20
00:01:32,013 --> 00:01:37,460
But her phone is shared with three other
accounts that pay flagged wallets, so the

21
00:01:37,460 --> 00:01:38,988
risk is raised to high.

22
00:01:39,987 --> 00:01:44,612
High-risk payments go to
the AI investigation agent.

23
00:01:44,562 --> 00:01:50,042
It runs seven tools, and writes a report
where every finding must cite real

24
00:01:50,042 --> 00:01:50,700
evidence.

25
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:56,923
No language model key is configured
here, so it uses its labelled, rule-based

26
00:01:56,923 --> 00:01:57,650
fallback.

27
00:01:57,650 --> 00:02:01,725
It recommends rejecting,
but it can't move money.

28
00:02:02,725 --> 00:02:05,700
A person makes the final call.

29
00:02:05,650 --> 00:02:11,939
The reviewer re-enters their password,
types the transaction ID, and approves,

30
00:02:11,939 --> 00:02:13,713
rejects, or escalates.

31
00:02:13,713 --> 00:02:17,688
Only an approval would let
PayPal capture the funds.

32
00:02:18,688 --> 00:02:22,763
Every step goes into a
tamper-evident audit log.

33
00:02:22,713 --> 00:02:28,839
Sentinel brings machine learning, connected
data, and AI investigation together, to

34
00:02:28,839 --> 00:02:32,825
make digital payments safer,
and easier to understand.

35
00:02:32,825 --> 00:02:34,400
Thank you.
